# Every variant, not just `.env`. `.env.local` is loaded *first* and therefore
# wins (see apps/api/src/config/env-files.ts), so a developer's local overrides
# would end up baked into the production image and quietly beat the defaults for
# anything the Dockerfile does not set itself - JWT_ACCESS_SECRET included.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
